        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "即使你拖曳過，彈出視窗每次都會在此處開啟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pop-up returns here for every dictation, even after you drag it.": {
